age":{"dimensions":{"width":980,"height":735},"alt":"Shot","copyright":null,"url":"https://images.prismic.io/catunic/28f3b002-d2ac-4d27-9aa1-b0f54d8acc20_shot-12.png?auto=format,compress","id":"ZU-0qxIAACMAlSwx","edit":{"x":0,"y":0,"zoom":1,"background":"transparent"}}}]},"link_type":"Document","key":"001ccf43-98d8-4898-b39c-abba48ce0c8e","isBroken":false}},"id":"works_gallery_block$1560e5f9-c8a2-4b9a-8789-c593a4bc689e","slice_type":"works_gallery_block","slice_label":null},{"variation":"default","version":"initial","items":[{"projectName":"GLS","projectLink":{"id":"ZR1SABEAAFYIgANf","type":"case","tags":["page"],"lang":"en-us","slug":"-","first_publication_date":"2023-10-04T12:28:24+0000","last_publication_date":"2023-11-12T13:20:46+0000","uid":"gls","url":"/work/gls","link_type":"Document","key":"09ad0b5a-4538-47b2-bd49-dac29c52dbcc","isBroken":false},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"I overhauled the UX/UI of an international package delivery service, modernizing it without losing its brand identity. Adding new sections and simplifying the design system, I collaborated closely with the brand team to update designs while maintaining their values. The result: a well-received, streamlined, and user-friendly service, boosting customer satisfaction and engagement.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},{"projectName":"Brisa","projectLink":{"id":"ZS2erREAABEOQUct","type":"case","tags":["page"],"lang":"en-us","slug":"-","first_publication_date":"2023-10-16T21:00:17+0000","last_publication_date":"2023-11-12T13:20:46+0000","uid":"brisa","url":"/work/brisa","link_type":"Document","key":"621de63b-10e5-48ef-84ae-ac9f2a39fd6f","isBroken":false},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"I updated an app for individuals with multiple sclerosis, focusing on enhancing user experience through new features while adhering to brand style principles. Through thorough research, prototypes, and testing, I ensured smooth and intuitive updates. Working closely with the development team, I implemented changes for an overall improvement in user experience, enhanced functionality, and a more consistent app design.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},{"projectName":"BestDrive","projectLink":{"id":"ZS6LnxEAAJMiRYum","type":"case","tags":["page"],"lang":"en-us","slug":"-","first_publication_date":"2023-10-17T13:29:19+0000","last_publication_date":"2023-11-12T13:20:48+0000","uid":"bestdrive","url":"/work/bestdrive","link_type":"Document","key":"4f6eefaa-1b7c-4d3f-9ef8-1e3b1f447df6","isBroken":false},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"I crafted the website for easy tire and oil change bookings. The design features a simple, intuitive booking form for tire changes, guiding users seamlessly through the process on both desktop and mobile devices. Additionally, I integrated an online store for convenient access to the company's products. The user-centered design ensures the website meets business goals, delivering value to clients.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},{"projectName":"Bentley","projectLink":{"link_type":"Any"},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"As a UI/UX designer, I revamped Bentley's official German website, enhancing the interface, adding new pages, and improving the overall user experience. The goal was to create an attractive and appealing website to engage potential customers. Meticulous attention to detail resulted in a successful update to the design and user experience.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},{"projectName":"Medion","projectLink":{"link_type":"Any"},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"In the project, I created personalized recommendations and optimized customer support to boost user experience, sales, and enhance the company's reputation. The outcome: heightened customer satisfaction and increased sales.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},{"projectName":"BMW Bank","projectLink":{"link_type":"Any"},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"I enhanced both web and mobile navigation for improved user experience. Through detailed analysis and a redesigned menu, I addressed the issue of confusion, making it more intuitive and user-friendly. The result: a significantly improved user experience across the website.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},{"projectName":"Warmintro","projectLink":{"link_type":"Any"},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"I modernized the platform, introduced features, and enhanced the user interface, creating an attractive and user-friendly social network. Collaborating with the project team, I ensured seamless implementation aligned with project goals. The updated platform concept garnered positive user feedback and increased engagement.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]},{"projectName":"Fartca","projectLink":{"id":"ZO4bERAAAB8A_08R","type":"case","tags":["page"],"lang":"en-us","slug":"-","first_publication_date":"2023-08-29T16:21:42+0000","last_publication_date":"2023-11-12T13:20:47+0000","uid":"fartca","url":"/work/fartca","link_type":"Document","key":"2ccc3806-47bc-4b3f-8250-875c4b0a7d1b","isBroken":false},"projectDescription":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"My main task was to create a convenient business platform to offer promotions and discounts to customers. Designed a new corporate identity and main service for receiving coupons, a personal account for distributors and two mobile applications. The project proved successful and helped companies increase their customer base and revenues through the use of promo codes.","spans":[],"direction":"ltr"}]}],"primary":{"title":"Experience","spacingTop":"2","spacingBottom":"2"},"id":"experience_block$4c2f39bb-84b3-48c9-9f71-efb1a6f84377","slice_type":"experience_block","slice_label":null},{"variation":"default","version":"initial","items":[{"textItem":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Digital Design","spans":[{"start":7,"end":14,"type":"strong"}],"direction":"ltr"}],"divider":"✦"},{"textItem":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Personalized Branding","spans":[{"start"